{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2018-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1542326400, "end_date": 1542931199, "month_true_total": 11813, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:58:12 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "46481986", "author": {"steamid": "76561198033694444", "personaname": "Artwolf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/artwolf24/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 360870, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 181031, "last_played": 1743958418, "avatar": "add8564167eeb6b51bc62f645a1f6c96f20ed808"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warframe is an awesome game with surprisingly in-depth systems. It can be a bit daunting for new players due to its complexity, but the community is always happy to help out. I have been playing this game for a long, long time and with frequent updates, awesome devs and massive (free) expansions, this game just keeps getting better and better and I am proud to have been along for the ride.\nIt's fun and it's free, go play it!", "timestamp_created": 1542931183, "timestamp_updated": 1606339198, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.547325074672698975", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "46481854", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072455830", "personaname": "NSparkle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nibushko/", "num_games_owned": 174, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 140989, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20607, "last_played": 1695809278, "avatar": "936d55082e96259b0f799a4e7abe01797f12855c"}, "language": "english", "review": "F2P done right", "timestamp_created": 1542931106, "timestamp_updated": 1542931106, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "46481850", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078676286", "personaname": "Corn Berserker", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Chrono_TriggerFinger/", "num_games_owned": 682, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 46142, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15970, "last_played": 1776025337, "avatar": "2d1f3279614c73c0e0aeac72e8db9e6f90838085"}, "language": "english", "review": "Probably one of the best F2P games I have ever played. It can be grindy at times, but don't let that stop you. The Devs really care about the community which is awesome. Plus a real world market that allows premium currency to be traded. That means that you never need to spend a cent on this game. But it does help the devs. So you should spend some money. And with the new open world update, you have so much more to do in an already HUGE game. \nI give it  a 9/10 only cause of the grind.", "timestamp_created": 1542931104, "timestamp_updated": 1542931104, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "46481732", "author": {"steamid": "76561198407671010", "personaname": "Rongji01", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Roniskroni01/", "num_games_owned": 157, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 79909, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 27837, "last_played": 1773011128, "avatar": "19ad529ef239c7b132e38f4c910fbbff467f39bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "its ok", "timestamp_created": 1542931035, "timestamp_updated": 1542931035, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 16, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "46481652", "author": {"steamid": "76561198081542979", "personaname": "ximera", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ximera91/", "num_games_owned": 211, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 11252, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10012, "last_played": 1673947456, "avatar": "8e481bfd4b5ceae7707cdd4207e519df8c94327f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not only it has a unique and extremely polished style, I also find it incredibly fun to play.\nThere're just too many good things I could say about this game that I don't even know where to start, and I think that lots of other people have already thorougly reviewed it in far better ways than I could do.\nSo I just want to say this to the developers and all the people that made this possible: your work is amazing, you're amazing for making it, and it's impossible not to see how much effort went into developing Warframe. Thank you.", "timestamp_created": 1542930997, "timestamp_updated": 1542930997, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}